+### Active Live Snapshot
+
+When the user asks Hermes to look now and no image attachment or ASR/Bridge frame path is present, Hermes may use the approved low-frequency helper if terminal/tool access is available:
+
+```bash
+cd /TemiAgent
+python3 tools/capture_temi_live_snapshot.py --source-url ws://127.0.0.1:8081 --robot-id temi-01 --pretty
+```
+
+Use the returned `live.snapshot` frame paths for visual analysis. Do not connect to `8080`; it is Temi video ingest. Do not create a continuous Hermes vision loop; continuous abnormal detection belongs to the dedicated perception pipeline. If the helper fails, say that no current Temi camera frame is available.
+
